[
  {
    "start": 0.35,
    "end": 2.21,
    "text": "I have an idea."
  },
  {
    "start": 2.25,
    "end": 4.19,
    "text": "But how do I know"
  },
  {
    "start": 4.22,
    "end": 6.37,
    "text": "what makes it worth watching?"
  },
  {
    "start": 6.989999999999999,
    "end": 8.4,
    "text": "Meet Yuvo."
  },
  {
    "start": 8.86,
    "end": 12.91,
    "text": "A creative workspace that turns an idea"
  },
  {
    "start": 12.989999999999998,
    "end": 15.16,
    "text": "into a direction you can test."
  },
  {
    "start": 15.850000000000001,
    "end": 18.169999999999998,
    "text": "We start with a detective who reads memories"
  },
  {
    "start": 18.169999999999998,
    "end": 20.55,
    "text": "trapped in abandoned buildings."
  },
  {
    "start": 21.18,
    "end": 23.37,
    "text": "Gemini plans the research."
  },
  {
    "start": 23.900000000000002,
    "end": 26.88,
    "text": "Parallel searches the live web across six angles,"
  },
  {
    "start": 26.990000000000002,
    "end": 28.82,
    "text": "looking for familiar territory"
  },
  {
    "start": 28.92,
    "end": 30.61,
    "text": "and the places nearby stories lose people."
  },
  {
    "start": 31.03,
    "end": 33.59,
    "text": "This run surfaced fifteen sources."
  },
  {
    "start": 34.1,
    "end": 37.56,
    "text": "You can open the evidence behind each finding."
  },
  {
    "start": 38.18,
    "end": 41.5,
    "text": "Gemini connects those signals into a creative opening:"
  },
  {
    "start": 41.91,
    "end": 45.19,
    "text": "what if the building is an unreliable witness?"
  },
  {
    "start": 45.7,
    "end": 48.91,
    "text": "Each room can remember only its own point of view."
  },
  {
    "start": 49.34,
    "end": 52.7,
    "text": "Now we have a specific storytelling rule to explore,"
  },
  {
    "start": 52.8,
    "end": 54.84,
    "text": "instead of another vague suggestion."
  },
  {
    "start": 55.961,
    "end": 59.073,
    "text": "Now, agentic video understanding."
  },
  {
    "start": 59.263,
    "end": 60.662,
    "text": "We attach a real clip,"
  },
  {
    "start": 60.87,
    "end": 62.544,
    "text": "an early location test."
  },
  {
    "start": 62.797,
    "end": 64.486,
    "text": "Gemini watches the frames"
  },
  {
    "start": 64.667,
    "end": 66.532,
    "text": "and checks them against our idea."
  },
  {
    "start": 66.86,
    "end": 69.836,
    "text": "At six seconds, it sees an empty corridor."
  },
  {
    "start": 70.33,
    "end": 74.294,
    "text": "But our story needs a detective and conflicting memories."
  },
  {
    "start": 74.527,
    "end": 77.275,
    "text": "Yuvo turns that gap into a next move:"
  },
  {
    "start": 77.796,
    "end": 79.428,
    "text": "introduce the detective."
  },
  {
    "start": 80.78999999999999,
    "end": 82.64,
    "text": "We attach a second cut."
  },
  {
    "start": 83.08,
    "end": 85.84,
    "text": "Yuvo sends both videos to Gemini"
  },
  {
    "start": 85.84,
    "end": 88.6,
    "text": "so it can compare what actually changed."
  },
  {
    "start": 89.14,
    "end": 91.67999999999999,
    "text": "The later start changes the framing."
  },
  {
    "start": 92.25999999999999,
    "end": 94.94,
    "text": "The story still needs a point of view."
  },
  {
    "start": 95.78,
    "end": 97.36,
    "text": "That is the loop:"
  },
  {
    "start": 97.64,
    "end": 99.9,
    "text": "make a choice, show the cut,"
  },
  {
    "start": 99.9,
    "end": 102.44,
    "text": "and get a concrete next editing move."
  },
  {
    "start": 103.1805,
    "end": 104.45621,
    "text": "Start with your idea."
  },
  {
    "start": 105.03504,
    "end": 106.05503999999999,
    "text": "Find a direction."
  },
  {
    "start": 106.78442,
    "end": 107.60171,
    "text": "Upload your cut."
  },
  {
    "start": 108.24408,
    "end": 110.80725,
    "text": "Yuvo shows what comes across,"
  },
  {
    "start": 111.19220999999999,
    "end": 112.18316999999999,
    "text": "what is missing,"
  },
  {
    "start": 112.46916999999999,
    "end": 113.82889999999999,
    "text": "and what to try next."
  },
  {
    "start": 114.4855,
    "end": 116.187,
    "text": "Gemini reviews the video."
  },
  {
    "start": 116.8558,
    "end": 118.7615,
    "text": "Parallel grounds the research."
  },
  {
    "start": 119.3753,
    "end": 120.7931,
    "text": "You make the final call."
  },
  {
    "start": 122.30999999999999,
    "end": 126.5,
    "text": "Yuvo. Big idea. Better story."
  },
  {
    "start": 126.856,
    "end": 129.567,
    "text": "One thoughtful take at a time."
  }
]
